![image.png](meeting-26-01-09%EF%BC%88%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E3%80%81length-adaptive%20TF%E3%80%81%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E3%80%81idea%E3%80%81/image%2071.png)

